# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Firmware/config dumps extracted via this project's own tooling (probe-flash,
# dump-flash, dump-setup). Excluded for now, not permanently: the project intent
# (PLAN.md §8) is to eventually PUBLISH reproducibly-verified official firmware
# dumps as a public community resource, once that reproducibility is confirmed —
# this exclusion should be revisited deliberately at that point, not left as a
# default. See dumps/README.md.
dumps/*.bin
dumps/*.hex


# Local secrets/state
.blheli32proxy/
*.pcap
*keylog*.txt

# This project tracks its own AI-instruction files (referenced from README.md/PLAN.md),
# overriding the user's global ~/.gitignore exclusion of them.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
